      "description": "Peça em leito de imagem neutro com nome e resumo em área de leitura.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-card-photo\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Representação de peça\"><path d=\"M38 88V44l42-23 42 23v44l-42 23z\" fill=\"#163bff\"/><path d=\"m38 44 42 24 42-24M80 68v43\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0818b7\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg></div><div class=\"ds-card-body\"><span>CASA &amp; DECORAÇÃO · CONCEITO</span><strong>Vaso Modular</strong><p>Forma e textura para o ambiente.</p></div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:block;width:280px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d8dbe5);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#353b51);text-decoration:none;font-family:Rambla,Arial,sans-serif;transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .3s}.ds-card-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface-soft,#f0f1f8)}.ds-card-photo svg{width:62%;transition:transform .3s}.ds-card-body{padding:21px 22px 25px}.ds-card-body span{display:block;color:var(--brand,#163bff);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em}.ds-card-body strong{display:block;margin:7px 0 8px;font-size:25px;line-height:1.08}.ds-card-body p{margin:0;color:var(--muted,#646b81);font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}.ds-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow,0 18px 50px rgba(53,59,81,.10))}.ds-card:hover .ds-card-photo svg{transform:scale(1.045)}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand-soft,#8697ff);outline-offset:4px}"
